{"kind": "fix", "step": 17, "ts": "2026-11-18T04:16:42.088578+00:00", "data": {"id": "wan_reload", "reason": "Modem has been OPERATIONAL since 02:28:21 (registration complete) yet the firewall still cannot reach the ISP gateway 198.51.100.1 (100% ping loss) while holding the pre-outage lease 198.51.100.27 on vtnet0. The watchdog logged a reload decision at 02:30 and a retry at 02:40 but ran in observe mode, so the WAN was never reconfigured. Re-applying the WAN config / renewing the DHCP lease against the re-registered modem is what restores service.", "options": {}, "outcome": "acted"}}
